## Ticket flow

- Every change corresponds to a ticket in `{{tickets_dir}}/`.
- Do not change a ticket's functional goals without updating the ticket.
- Closing a ticket: verify every acceptance criterion, mark it done in the backlog, then commit
  with the format `<type>(<area>): <TID> - <title>`.
- A ticket is not closed while any quality gate is red, even one the ticket did not touch.

## Quality gates

The gates are declared in `.agents/workflow.toml`. Run them with `/quality-gate`.

## Rules learned

Each repeated mistake becomes a rule here, with the ticket or commit that taught it.
